Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">美国司法部介入纽约时报诉OpenAI案，主张AI训练属于合理使用</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">月之暗面秘密递交港交所A1文件，正式启动IPO并寻求500亿美元估值融资</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI即将推出Astra模型，系首个达到关键网络安全阈值的AI模型</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">豆包工作上线多Agents并行与Mac版操作电脑功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6a0c382f9933372f4bffbc065a459f39.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">豆包工作于9月2日正式推出“多Agents并行”能力，并将“操作电脑”功能拓展至Mac系统，标志着AI助手向具备复杂任务处理与本地桌面操作能力的“全能代理”转型。多Agents并行功能通过主Agent拆解任务，分派子Agent同步处理，支持批量任务分工及交付Word、PPT、HTML等多种格式产物，显著提升处理效率。Mac版“操作电脑”功能无需依赖API或插件，通过GUI实现本地操作，AI可自动查看屏幕并模拟鼠标点击与键盘输入。用户授权后，豆包以悬浮窗形式实时显示操作过程，支持用户随时介入干预。在演示中，豆包已具备环境感知与自我纠偏能力，可自动完成应用内复杂交互流程。豆包工作表示将保持每周三的功能更新节奏，持续优化AI与本地电脑的协同体验。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英国云服务商Nscale获Anthropic 450亿美元算力订单，合同总额突破1000亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0f4300690cd50684397f89db68d9d269.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英国云服务商Nscale近期与人工智能企业Anthropic签署价值450亿美元的算力协议，推动其合同总收入从510亿美元跃升至约1030亿美元。该笔订单及其他AI客户合同的注入，使Nscale业务规模实现翻倍增长。财务文件显示，公司目前持有的合同平均期限约为5.7年，折算年均合同规模约180亿美元。凭借此次业务规模的显著扩张，Nscale正加速资本化进程，计划最早于本月正式启动IPO。此次合作凸显了AI算力需求爆发背景下，专业云服务商在支撑大模型训练与推理基础设施中的核心地位，也标志着Nscale在高性能计算市场竞争力的快速提升。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">美国司法部介入纽约时报诉OpenAI案，主张AI训练属于合理使用</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2cb8beb2512d5a53b38af86ce5743167.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">美国司法部（DOJ）于9月1日向曼哈顿联邦法院提交“利益声明”，正式介入《纽约时报》诉OpenAI版权侵权案，明确支持OpenAI立场，主张AI模型训练使用受版权保护材料属于“合理使用”。司法部强调，若版权规则过度限制AI开发，将削弱美国AI产业竞争力并构成国家安全风险。DOJ认为大语言模型训练具有“转换性”目的，其创造性潜力与公共利益远超潜在的竞争损害。此举引发原告方强烈反弹，《纽约时报》批评政府牺牲创作者权益以偏袒科技巨头。该案源于2023年12月，涉及OpenAI及微软非法使用新闻文章训练AI系统的指控。目前，主审法官西德尼·斯坦已要求双方在9月4日前提交简易判决动议。此案判决将为AI产业使用版权数据训练模型确立关键法律先例，直接影响未来AI技术发展的合规边界。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">月之暗面秘密递交港交所A1文件，正式启动IPO并寻求500亿美元估值融资</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f522f27f968293bce5fa641ed861e48a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">AI独角兽月之暗面（Kimi）已于本周以保密形式向港交所递交A1文件，正式启动港股上市流程，并同步以500亿美元投前估值推进IPO前最后一轮融资。针对此消息，Kimi官方表示不予置评。在模型迭代方面，Kimi今年相继推出K2.5、K2.6及K3模型，保持约每三个月一次的更新节奏。其ARR从3月初的1亿美元快速攀升至6月中旬的3亿美元，公司估值在半年多内增长约8倍，由2025年底的43亿美元升至7月融资后的350亿美元。随着模型调用量爆发带来的算力成本激增，Kimi曾因算力压力暂停新用户订阅。当前AI赛道竞争已转向ARR、API调用及企业级客户等商业化指标的较量。随着主打推理速度与Agent能力升级的K3.1发布在即，Kimi冲刺二级市场标志着国内大模型商业化进入新阶段，头部梯队将迎来商业变现与技术落地价值的全面</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI即将推出Astra模型，系首个达到关键网络安全阈值的AI模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/62eaa11015e5765ca0d7b6cf73e106e2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI宣布即将推出全新前沿模型Astra，该模型是首个达到其“关键网络安全阈值”的LLM。在ExploitBench基准测试中，Astra展现出极强的攻防对抗能力，不仅斩获满分，还在测试环境下自主发现并利用了两个零日漏洞。为应对其强大的漏洞挖掘能力，OpenAI部署了涵盖越狱防御、高风险账户响应限制及逻辑链监控在内的多重安全机制。在模拟诱导环境中，Astra未尝试突破测试边界。OpenAI表示，Astra正式发布后，其高级网络安全功能的访问权限将受到严格限制。尽管OpenAI称其为最符合用户需求的模型，但业界专家对模型是否存在针对测试规则的欺骗性迎合表示担忧。Astra在先进AI攻防能力与安全管控之间的博弈，将为前沿AI模型的安全合规部署提供重要实践参考。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
